<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>

  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <title><%= title %></title>
  <link rel="icon" href="/icons/favicon.ico" type="image/x-icon">
  <style>
    body {
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      max-width: 800px;
      margin: 2rem auto;
      padding: 0 1rem;
      line-height: 1.6;
      background-color: #f9f9f9;
    }.dark_mode{
        background-color: #333;
        color: #f9f9f9;   
    }
    .dark_mode h1{
        color: #f9f9f9;
    }
    .dark_mode .editor-toolbar,
    .dark_mode .CodeMirror{
        background-color: #222;
        color: #eee;
    }
    .dark_mode .CodeMirror-cursor{
        border-left: 1px solid #fff;
    }
    .dark_mode .actions a{
        background-color: #444;
        color:#eee;
        border-color: #666 ;
    }

    .dark_toggle{
        position: fixed;
        top: 1rem;
        right: 1rem;
        padding: 0.5rem 1rem;
        font-size: 0.9rem;
    }
   
.dark_mode .editor-toolbar {
  background-color: #2b2b2b;
  border-color: #444;
}

.dark_mode .editor-toolbar button {
  color: #ddd;
}

.dark_mode .editor-toolbar button:hover {
  background-color: #3a3a3a;
}

.dark_mode .CodeMirror {
  background-color: #1e1e1e;
  color: #f9f9f9;
  border-color: #444;
}

.dark_mode .CodeMirror-gutters {
  background-color: #1e1e1e;
  border-right: 1px solid #444;
}

.dark_mode .CodeMirror-cursor {
  border-left: 1px solid #fff;
}

.dark_mode .CodeMirror-selected {
  background-color: #555 !important;
}

.dark_mode .CodeMirror-line::selection,
.dark_mode .CodeMirror-line > span::selection {
  background-color: #555;
}


    h1 {
      text-align: center;
      color: #333;
    }

    form {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 1rem;
      margin-top: 1rem;
    }

    button {
      width: 120px;
      padding: 0.5rem;
      font-size: 1rem;
      border: none;
      border-radius: 4px;
      background-color: #4CAF50;
      color: white;
      cursor: pointer;
    }

    button:hover {
      background-color: #45a049;
    }

    .actions {
      margin-top: 1rem;
    }

    .actions a {
      text-decoration: none;
      color: #555;
      padding: 0.5rem 1rem;
      border: 1px solid #ccc;
      border-radius: 4px;
      background-color: #eee;
    }

    .actions a:hover {
      background-color: #ddd;
    }

 .theme_toggle {
  position: fixed;
  top: 1rem;
  right: 1rem;
  z-index: 9999;
  cursor: pointer;
}

.toggle_track {
  width: 64px;
  height: 32px;
  background: #ddd;
  border-radius: 16px;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: space-between;
  padding: 0 6px;
  position: relative;
}

.toggle_thumb {
  position: absolute;
  top: 3px;
  left: 3px;
  width: 26px;
  height: 26px;
  background: white;
  border-radius: 50%;
  transition: transform 0.3s ease;
}

.dark_mode .toggle_thumb {
  transform: translateX(45px);
}


.icon {
    width: 16px;
    height: 16px;
  font-size: 14px;
  z-index: 1;
}
.sun,
.moon {
  opacity: 0.6;
  transition: opacity 0.3s ease;
}

.dark_mode .sun {
  opacity: 0.3;
}

.dark_mode .moon {
  opacity: 1;
}

body:not(.dark_mode) .sun {
  opacity: 1;
}

body:not(.dark_mode) .moon {
  opacity: 0.3;
}

.dark_mode .toggle_track {
  background: #555;
}
.home-logo-link {
  position: fixed;   
  top: 1rem;         
  left: 1rem;        
  z-index: 1000;     
}

.home-logo {
  width: 144px;       
  height: 144px;
  cursor: pointer;   
  transition: opacity 0.3s;
}

.home-logo-link:hover .home-logo {
  opacity: 0.8;      
}
.search-form {
  position: relative;
  max-width: 500px;
  margin: 0 auto;
}

.search-form input[type="text"] {
  width: 100%;
  padding: 0.5rem 2.5rem 0.5rem 0.5rem; /* room for icon */
  font-size: 1rem;
  border: 1px solid #ccc;
  border-radius: 4px;
}

.search-form .search-btn {
  position: absolute;
  right: -5.75rem;
  top: 50%;
  transform: translateY(-50%);
  border: none;
  background: none;
  cursor: pointer;
  color: #555;
  padding: 0;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
}

.search-form .search-btn svg {
  width: 20px;
  height: 20px;
}

.search-form .search-btn:hover svg {
  color: #000;
}
.search-icon{
    width:50px;
    height:50px;
}

    .btn-create {
      width: 120px;
      padding: 0.5rem;
      font-size: 1rem;
      border: none;
      border-radius: 4px;
      background-color: #4CAF50;
      color: white;
      cursor: pointer;
    }

    .btn-create:hover {
      background-color: #45a049;
    }

  </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class = "theme_toggle" onclick="dark_mode()">
    <div class="toggle_track">
        <img src ="/icons/sun.svg" class="icon sun" alt="Light Mode">
        <img src ="/icons/moon.svg" class = "icon moon" alt="Dark Mode">
        <div class="toggle_thumb"></div>
    </div>
    </div>
<a href="/" class="home-logo-link">
  <img src="/icons/logo.png" alt="Home" class="home-logo">
</a>




  <h1><%= title %></h1>
  <h3>Navigating the Wiki</h3>
  <ul>
    <li>Using the search bar is currently the most effective way to navigate the wiki<ol>The search bar works by looking through the text / title for the searched word</ol></:></li>
    
    
  </ul>
<h3>Creating Pages</h3>
<ol>
    <li>Click the button on the home page to start creating a wiki page</li>
    <li>Enter the title that will act as the header of the page</li>
    <li>Enter the slug <ol>- This is the url that the directs to the page. For most wikis it will be the same as the title with dashes instead of spaces.</ol></li>
    <li>Fill content as needed.
        <ol>- These pages currently use markdown for formmatting. Linked is a markdown guide that shows basic markdown to help</ol>
        <ol>- For images, we can take advantage of this fact to display them without any hosting, which is not implemented yet. </ol>
        <ol><a href="https://drive.google.com/file/d/1_6ayjFwLkE-AndUswuXOAIa73XJtFsOg/view?usp=sharing" target="_blank">- Here</a> is a quick video showcasing how it is done.</ol>
        <ol>**Note that there is a limited amount of time that these images will be hosted for. I will try to add image hosting at some point, but as it is expensive to do so, it may be a while before it is added**</ol>
    </li>
</ol>
<h3>Editing / Deleting Wikis</h3>
 <ul>
    <li>Every wiki has an "Edit this page" link at the top of the pages that has both editing and deleting pages<ol>Note that slugs / urls cannot be changed and the page will need to be remade if the slug / url needs to be changed</ol></li>

 </ul> 

 <script>
function dark_mode() {
  document.body.classList.toggle("dark_mode");

  localStorage.setItem(
    "darkMode",
    document.body.classList.contains("dark_mode") ? "true" : "false"
  );

 
  if (window.simplemde) {
    simplemde.codemirror.refresh();
  }
}


if (localStorage.getItem("darkMode") === "true") {
  document.body.classList.add("dark_mode");
}
</script>

<footer>
